# Un-ignore AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md against a machine-wide global gitignore that excludes them everywhere by default. README.md symlinked to AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md is this repository's deliberate "one instruction file" pattern, so these symlinks must be tracked.
!AGENTS.md
!CLAUDE.md
!**/AGENTS.md
!**/CLAUDE.md
